  "solution": "Concept Used: \n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d0dde522f65134a981f8db6f1ac5aebe5108510a68c758df909f765f209687bd.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n( { 16(2)/(3) ÷ 10} ) - [ {( {(8)/(3) × (5)/(4)} )of(2)/(5) + frac{{16}}{3} × frac{{11}}{8} - ( {(1)/(4) ÷ (1)/({28)}} )} ]\n\n⇒ (50/3 ÷ 10) – [(8/3 × 5/4) of 2/5 + 16/3 × 11/8 – (1/4 ÷ 1/28)]\n\n⇒ (50/3 × 1/10) – [(8/3 × 5/4) of 2/5 + 16/3 × 11/8 – (1/4 ÷ 1/28)]\n\n⇒ 5/3 – [(8/3 × 5/4) of 2/5 + 16/3 × 11/8 – (1/4 ÷ 1/28)]\n\n⇒ 5/3 – [10/3 of 2/5 + 16/3 × 11/8 – (1/4 ÷ 1/28)]\n\n⇒ 5/3 – [10/3 of 2/5 + 16/3 × 11/8 – (1/4 × 28)]\n\n⇒ 5/3 – [10/3 of 2/5 + 16/3 × 11/8 – 7]\n\n⇒ 5/3 – [10/3 × 2/5 + 16/3 × 11/8 – 7]\n\n⇒ 5/3 – [4/3 + 16/3 × 11/8 – 7]\n\n⇒ 5/3 – (4/3 + 22/3 – 7)\n\n⇒ 5/3 – (4 + 22 – 21)/3\n\n⇒ 5/3 – (26 – 21)/3\n\n⇒ 5/3 – 5/3\n\n⇒ 0\n\n**∴ The required value is 0**\n\nf1",
